    "name": "Aurora Dawn Poet",
    "steam_appid": 3570500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/3818da383ce599d408acb539dbae927f.avif?t=1749045617\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>AURORA [DAWN POET]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a lyrical and heartbreaking journey through the New York of the 1920s by the hand of Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AURORA [DAWN POET], you will explore a dazzling and cruel city to the rhythm of the poetry of Poet in New York, the most existential book by the author from Granada. Each of the ten levels reinterprets a different poem as an interactive experience: platformers to the tune of \u2018They're Black in Cuba\u2019, mazes inspired by \u2018The King of Harlem\u2019 or frenetic chases influenced by \u2018City Without Sleep\u2019.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/5766517b6ba1588b6ac00e2097cde37e.poster.avif?t=1749045617\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/5766517b6ba1588b6ac00e2097cde37e.webm?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/5766517b6ba1588b6ac00e2097cde37e.mp4?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1e436223c9c90515b1f69cf77c6bfc71.avif?t=1749045617\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first videogame starring Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a New York of light and shadow, where modernity and alienation collide at the dawn of the Crash of '29.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore 10 poetic levels, each based on a poem from Poet in New York, with unique mechanics and dreamlike settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat, solve puzzles and uncover secrets through dialogue trees and narrative challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter eccentric and poignant characters that populate the streets, jazz joints and avenues of a bustling city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1bfe83093d1b86732961e637edbaf931.poster.avif?t=1749045617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1bfe83093d1b86732961e637edbaf931.webm?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1bfe83093d1b86732961e637edbaf931.mp4?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowds of Coney Island, the bureaucracy of Wall Street, the freedom of Harlem, the poverty of the slums, jazz and the crash of '29 change his outlook on life and mark him profoundly.<br><br>This video game tries to reflect the journey, not of the great poet, but of the young man who travels to the big city to \u2018find himself and love himself\u2019. In Aurora [Dawn Poet] you will discover Federico's poetry in a completely new way: will you be able to guide Federico through the labyrinth of his feelings and bring him safely back to Spain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/3818da383ce599d408acb539dbae927f.avif?t=1749045617\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>AURORA [DAWN POET]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a lyrical and heartbreaking journey through the New York of the 1920s by the hand of Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AURORA [DAWN POET], you will explore a dazzling and cruel city to the rhythm of the poetry of Poet in New York, the most existential book by the author from Granada. Each of the ten levels reinterprets a different poem as an interactive experience: platformers to the tune of \u2018They're Black in Cuba\u2019, mazes inspired by \u2018The King of Harlem\u2019 or frenetic chases influenced by \u2018City Without Sleep\u2019.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/5766517b6ba1588b6ac00e2097cde37e.poster.avif?t=1749045617\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/5766517b6ba1588b6ac00e2097cde37e.webm?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/5766517b6ba1588b6ac00e2097cde37e.mp4?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1e436223c9c90515b1f69cf77c6bfc71.avif?t=1749045617\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first videogame starring Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through a New York of light and shadow, where modernity and alienation collide at the dawn of the Crash of '29.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore 10 poetic levels, each based on a poem from Poet in New York, with unique mechanics and dreamlike settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat, solve puzzles and uncover secrets through dialogue trees and narrative challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter eccentric and poignant characters that populate the streets, jazz joints and avenues of a bustling city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1bfe83093d1b86732961e637edbaf931.poster.avif?t=1749045617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1bfe83093d1b86732961e637edbaf931.webm?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570500/extras/1bfe83093d1b86732961e637edbaf931.mp4?t=1749045617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crowds of Coney Island, the bureaucracy of Wall Street, the freedom of Harlem, the poverty of the slums, jazz and the crash of '29 change his outlook on life and mark him profoundly.<br><br>This video game tries to reflect the journey, not of the great poet, but of the young man who travels to the big city to \u2018find himself and love himself\u2019. In Aurora [Dawn Poet] you will discover Federico's poetry in a completely new way: will you be able to guide Federico through the labyrinth of his feelings and bring him safely back to Spain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "AURORA [DAWN POET] is a narrative adventure where you play as the writer Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca on his journey through New York City, writing Poet in New York. Explore, solve puzzles and immerse yourself in the duality of the tail end of 1920s\u2014the last signs of the looming Depression.\u00a0",
